  "releaseNotes": "Breaking: retarget from netstandard2.0 to net10.0.\n\t\t\tSerialization moved from Newtonsoft.Json to System.Text.Json; the Newtonsoft.Json dependency is gone.\n\t\t\tRepeated data object members moved onto shared base classes (PaginationLinks,\n\t\t\tDeviceExtendedDetailsResource, DeviceReferenceData, StatisticsResourceObject). Source\n\t\t\tcompatible - every property and nested TypeEnum is still reached through the same type -\n\t\t\tbut callers compiled against an earlier build need a rebuild.\n\t\t\tUpdated dependencies (Microsoft.Extensions.Logging, Refit).\n\t\t\tAdopted Central Package Management.",
